      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2662,
      "text": "For every community We ordained ways[35] of worship which they follow, so do not let them dispute with you [O Prophet] in this matter. But call them to your Lord, for you are indeed on the straight guidance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 340,
      "ruku": 293,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2663,
      "text": "And if they argue with you, say, “Allah knows best what you are doing.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 340,
      "ruku": 293,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2664,
      "text": "Allah will judge between you on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which you used to differ.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 340,
      "ruku": 293,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2665,
      "text": "Do you not know that Allah knows all that is in heaven and on earth? That is all [written] in a Record[36]. This is indeed easy for Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 340,
      "ruku": 293,
      "hizbQuarter": 136,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2666,
      "text": "Yet they worship other than Allah that for which He has not sent down any authority, and of which they have no knowledge. The wrongdoers will have no helper.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
